      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Your reporting currency depends on your [`pricingCurrency`](pricingcurrency.md), as follows:",
      "normalizedSource": "Your reporting currency depends on your [`pricingCurrency`](pricingcurrency.md), as follows:",
