      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Determine Your Reporting Currency",
      "contextAfter": "If your `pricingCurrency` is on the list of allowed values for `reportingCurrency`, then you must use the same currency to report transaction amounts. Set the `reportingCurrency` field to match the `pricingCurrency` field, and don’t include an [`exchangeRate`](exchangerate.md) field in the line item.",
