      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "If your `pricingCurrency` isn’t on the list of allowed values for `reportingCurrency`, then you must use EUR or USD as the reporting currency. Use an exchange rate to convert the line item amounts from the pricing currency to the reporting currency, and include the exchange rate in the [`exchangeRate`](exchangerate.md) field. For more information, see [`exchangeRate`](exchangerate.md).",
